{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1330,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77742d0b37c2b0d99462fd7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、寒くないですか？\r\n忍法ぽかぽかの術なら、\r\nいつでもしてあげますからね～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5189b9d6e2d7561f8212e94a95eed316dcb41a57d200869c8fc96c1b24763b17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:243041fbdd8e7a1ffdcf8438",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいですよね～、分身の術♪\r\nほら、みんなを同時に\r\nいいこいいこできますし～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc128805cc60b02d1b36b4c7c959d247ef6d59c940344797b85ab72519f4285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe55f7d75e74644f29b4be8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍者らしく陰から静かに見守って…\r\nうぅ～、やっぱり我慢できません！\r\n直接たっくさん構いたいです～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50cbd06cb479bd0affe30f4bdb94b7b0b8be1c1766380c0dc095f6e03da66df6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219770fdb71aff9e0ee14b20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们今天也照自己的步调，\r\n不勉强地努力吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd662796283919e6f9d7cc97df26b3ae5625e474c7dfa71eb9e99f4810d357f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d87a62ff2644ceb7116269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張りますね～",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ff6f5bde34db00ec59654aa3b8afd6a8e07c3cc3c2b3321fb88e0be26832f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e8ba5a2555da1f75762a9a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天做什么好呢？\r\n不要着急，慢慢想就好哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f077dac87f60efc91a217b64dd4197c660e5119e8e5007b64fbf412949245300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73c0352d4674954bf7b7cfab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烦恼该做什么时，就都先尝试看看吧。\r\n没问题的，就算失败了，\r\n也会成为以后的经验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "139309f0b60a044e718350311f2ce9e6e174ebb2af8270cdb918e155bb67f74e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b8e4ce525ab8177e0539e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别看我这样，跑步时锲而不舍的韧性\r\n可是受到肯定的哦。\r\n要不要在训练的时候测试一下？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeb68a520b4552646b71398d1872fb4d8ec6da4f3c165ba1af9c19decaacc53b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8954c7c8787503019cb56c51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好认真的表情……呵呵，放松一点。\r\n无论是什么样的练习，\r\n我都会让训练员露出笑容的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "024ec9ad0cd239a61cddd567861362d39376f27c9bf290932417efa201e61f0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a3122658d091ec18e02434b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总是很努力的训练员。\r\n如果有什么我能帮忙的地方，\r\n请千万不要客气，要让我知道哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5287709954acda74d1863257b4e87381d04af1eadf5f168efeab3856b1f1b7e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5831e59499170a7c588f7a3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么样的训练安排都没问题的。\r\n因为我是发自内心信任训练员的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5976bf5f1f403c771a7a364511bdb7c8cdddca97e73f7d829ebb9fdcd544f181",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0e025628ee493d053ea7664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行程已经安排好了吗？\r\n呵呵，我很期待训练员\r\n为我制定的项目哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd49d9fed97e4446021a20544f635e719addaf275582ba44de2024177422c72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c289d8266e9b52c1f4bee824",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好努力练习，\r\n之后让大家吓一跳吧。\r\n我很擅长给人惊喜的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d58013c157a6ba0075c9780f8bac876eaac3679fe366f0f61d8cf62725329d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3ce09fcd7e74b6bf3c969cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身绷带是用即使激烈运动\r\n也不会散开的方式缠绕。\r\n我也很会用运动贴布的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b3046a96e4969609e6f984e3a3ef0353ae6277c611b71c68a15d10f4572b4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91edb3c2d65d3413156f1206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才有后辈误会，\r\n问我说「你身上的伤还好吗」。\r\n真是个体贴的孩子呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "efec321e90b28c88972380aca6234f8d362ac8619f403d1ffb0af72f073ba8ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db4a04228755b9b255cca9fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿！\r\n我对你下了想要撒娇的诅咒。\r\n呵呵，想要我摸摸你了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b69bd6b14c3580e7b05e5d2ddce4bcda69d2e25aa547a36b2fe9a7ffd327d26c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:995b11065719c7e8264bc2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了～我是Mummy喔～\r\n为了照顾训练员，\r\n从永恒的睡眠中醒来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25ac3fccb236aa8bd60a2b8442df0b8d85bb24cabb48d82cd20c5e4101f4ae6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2677a3addc38e8f92c8d8e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要训练员希望，\r\n我会永远照顾你。\r\n毕竟我是不死之身的Mummy～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef172acabc7c5fe56ed835fdb597700177bc00a93245a5802b11c1a4be7971f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:622e3df08259e0f692982329",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许我被下了诅咒，\r\n所以才会变得比任何人都想\r\n疼爱训练员也说不定……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa08395f22e57adde11acf09ed7dc734d21c2c02c68cb1980ba49eec2dce2373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fc3d74be6deffe991ff3cea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんな厳しいトレーニングも\r\nシュシュっと身軽に\r\nこなしますよ～！にんにんっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f38e99560dad210a3adbc9135e35965b28e0181ece01dd4bd80630589a497165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1116b28f5b5531aa96fedd64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつもトレーニングを考えてくれる\r\nトレーナーさんはすごいですね～。\r\nなでなでの術させてほしいです～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d5f6ff7e8bbac4dfca50071a0d47412e1e90cc480dde7ef9e8fbeb59099869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c0ebaf2bb5303e6b0d6eba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝は早起きさんでした～。どんな\r\nメニューを用意してくれたんだろう\r\nって、昨日から待ちきれなくて♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0d50156595fa260826bd5075ce45dd90f3a31d54796585beed251e6f66b150",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbc08662e0b68ef3545084b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんは、いつもやる気に\r\nさせてくれますね～。もしかして、\r\n私に忍術を使ってますか？ふふっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2dfe337698dd8143dee8ec9fec00ea4ec270fdd7e69533b2e16136af435903c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4705eadbf229d5d28984376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍びの里から、こっそり参上です。\r\nけど、レースでは目立ってみせます\r\nから、安心してくださいね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56445a57d1e0de1caa5d9d7974ea0411ddcbfe76475eea559803e08b8653d2e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b35fcc5a92bc60470864008e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングが終わったら、今日も\r\n一生懸命なトレーナーさんに\r\nよしよしの術をかけてあげますね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b779d1ba2b50e5bbd5309f7769fae0c2107c3e666c9b37d6b70f6e19d3ed8911",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dae85cb887fc5d9c71b928c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うふふっ、トレーナーさんはもう\r\n忍法甘えたがりの術中にハマって\r\nますよ～。とってもいいこいいこ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2b9c6fd699609e1e4d09d86f5d3c24404a0fcd2609f8c44bc5b557158ec226",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dfe4240cd97dcd4afc962f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不愧是我自豪的训练员呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a69bbbe3ecbd078631cd927af0c53d533d913d66f0042353657c6649e0d67666",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc06f8fbb052e212ff137875",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，我有达到你对我的期许吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d0fd230bea82039b5c8b76f077045e088cabb438ca617abf4be0f5149311c2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b394e16e479802e260635e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉自己达到\r\n比金字塔还高的顶端～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "41153336ce69dde30ab9741ab29c3ea0dfc5de9b362b5ba02ee981d1799cb935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87ddd16f4d6b369231849ab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种从深沉睡眠中\r\n醒来的感觉♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f49fe8b3038ab1bdd5df0df262094214a5017ad503c525ba60781ee3dce88dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1ceee4eddd5349558de400c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うふふっ、この喜びは忍ばせられませんね～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef420b6fffcc01bab78b36364a6ebca3933e8426c2b97a7d7bebc8c92f216499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33625d79977e9e6e08272289",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お世話忍法でたっくさんお礼させてください♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7626eb08eb77653a7589912c2481682375763ee88fc654da5ac52b38b2e773e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de84751754e333c72b310f11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……呵呵呵，你也会为我感到高兴吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e72859b35c5615635b009d43b4564553c71e47d7882971a6ac40aa98f5a473c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69ab2ed60edba1086571f2a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都是训练员一直为我努力的关系～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fae08d41a68941aed0ff250baee01a42e4fd806df46bd178a0a97bdef8efd46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c8df016f1c76b689942225",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是的，我叫做超级溪流哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b9416ceb13169300e7a4a2cfa64263d3b0599075673ed69d1d6003c933dc86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db216fa538b5968d87ecdfc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，尽量依赖我没关系的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "00b1196f539f9e33040cdf4088d4ea1525d3fe24e5b8055d7cd509c7c09ce121",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d95546f7d4c5f752458cbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以尽情跟我撒娇哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e3734ad3894ac342b1c7ee2a701fcd7fc23d36e2812bed60e1153189cc2dc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:605f857cc567858659e9f7ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，我重生了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e4a431a52b77ac901148ec9e10753effcc466bd5763e030feea0b3236059364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58145cd0b6c65215f4664795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要疼爱你的诅咒\r\n似乎又变得更强了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a01bc6206eb422db832bf89530d55b51378acd9bf8528f16f5cf76906acb1dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d7b99c9d4dfa3d4168b730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不必感到害怕哟，\r\n因为我是你的Mummy～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "80b8a7d007f05fe6bf00ac3be177bb932257e279ab9b48a7f2342d6e26f54730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96958ee8ff315f5d0af2d151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是超级溪流。\r\n是你的Mummy喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "44fc116a8bd80f38b72c4069fa424294c3ec9ddb843dc3af4d1a904d0eec2b5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab59e330fe8f6ee62ad13ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うふふ、修行の成果です♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53b98a9787fc3faaaf305da4ca7443e6e43ac4da3d9f5103c3a38b1cea3c3f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dffe31eb988e6581b831620d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが、\r\nお世話忍法の極意ですね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9b20cd666c5788308bc904068aaab98fbc096da7b43d11a1c858dced9655de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5ef795ce2265e3e5cc725e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍法・お世話の術♪\r\nよ～しよ～し。",
      "source_fingerprint": "679ddbf16919470fb4425c4a94a6a8852dae87edbc0f88f8bac5d13fd46c4489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead8545dcfb994665a0e5c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スーパークリークですよ～。\r\nにんにん♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a555abfc67caf7a38692ad2533457c03c544be17ae3bd91b54d99ff844925653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1b5dedf8f2c02228ed569e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c967e75e39f341bde454f3e389531a0943b2e9cb665d31e66635fcd79e310da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c62e71d12129226781dc7a86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有各位的支援，\n飞鹰子一定能够成为\n顶尖的沙之偶像的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1639055a8420a24141f209f6f86393f70d614864c0af1c8065b99845e7e4811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b7600e1cd181846a121185f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87c73674448030810201b02536701821e85b098250d29146354877d722be62e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e46db1254ab513be44adc04c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e05e0d01b97d8e287ed643df53f6aec75f4a5750baabbde30c05707ea450b4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710f3bb9eb6b2425f30d958c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是飞鹰子『逃掉』的话，\n第一个追上来的粉丝肯定是训练员吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7bd067ab621a95a7518586a466e621c10ec5c9506f6f40a21f824adbac11320",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f251cc0e96cdf0954fd1fd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也要因为飞鹰子的光辉而变得闪闪发光了哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cbcec83f2abb6b23c9b39b0e7f6fbc4a9da8381552e060f1c25794159ac5028",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cbf32271f6e2b24f7993b1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐～！\n要是哪天飞鹰子能在什么新年节目里出场的话，\n就想试试看表演『偶像的隐藏秘技』呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba2e6633071a9bd7f6e5f40af8046c793b5d58159245c6dc766d3e42659b818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b42ef3e051b09376b36a3f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子一直都爱着所有粉丝哦！\n所以，训练员也情人节快乐哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "59a9c5e98a4caabe95e4bfb93caedadef04646d533963a6b9f40f6d284fdcd68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a31c3f85c1f74af3025e31c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿……要记得对大家保密哦☆\n这是送给训练员的本命……感谢巧克力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7e5457a00cbf0f2ed0461e20247600150a77f25d14ff700ac1e31f9a988bc52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d282f225c3a8d9ed83ae104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想好七夕节的愿望啦！\n希望大家看到闪闪发光的飞鹰子的时候，\n都能露出发自内心的笑容☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0777d5cb063329e18fcc6db174236d79ff17b407d4e60b95178ae837e2d79240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e389e1053c2c35f92f228ed2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Trick or Live！什么的，\n开玩笑啦……不对呀！\n那要是收到糖果的话，岂不是不能举办Live了？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b20f54959c5d50f0a898466863a1524b3b2d7ba9c06be1a3c4000c3af2ae1fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc728d950ea05e25b39cd59d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节的彩灯、\n再加上飞鹰子闪闪发光的Live…\n听上去很浪漫呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78e888cbe3fd18612bd9ee72c8dc3587cd2eee595fa4661019a6de228f9cf35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7bf1e50ded4044df1e76e1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐☆\n今天的话，\n要不要飞鹰子只为了训练员而献唱呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "110e9ad8b2d4c933af9741eb2499d7ff692bcc2157252755fbba0351ca421a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0afe9c20125fbd750da15caf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家的支持！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2f0ec79472b46492fd3e8ded60fde222d4a2e789bf64a346f40f7a46151a894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:107d31994ab11a47d015ac75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！一起看看年末特别节目吧！\n看看今年会有怎样风格的孩子出场，\n说不定能成为明年的参考哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57d8a8c36a79a798fbefa14bf91ab24de8d32690702df8f74533efc1acd44f00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dbac853e13db9d2a6ad23d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐♪\n飞鹰子为训练员准备了一首特别的歌作为生日礼物哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb2c7afca4b39272a2b787cad30f9b2a39ffe1d71047af628419203a7a71917",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d60bb1bd0f3c87b52662a552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子的第一个粉丝是训练员，真是太好了呢……\n生日快乐哦，训练员☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7d35df9fe664c53fcdfd219fd507edf99ec3ffe733530e7b0c8b00a299fb4e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8083fa2e2a2286bd785a5b64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是飞鹰子的生日哦☆\n纪念Live上该唱什么好呢……\n对了，训练员也要来看哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6975799e444bdae08baa84d5cf98cda435c02ed1479303b757b6e5d3d880a72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b7ff027d129427cc6bf8cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是明年还是后年……\n都希望训练员是第一个来跟我说新年快乐的人呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f131640cea27e853d9eb0f072f969f19dddcf7211b8f8c7c1acc6b4b702272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90ceaab53fbef335e0caa10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，有新的通知哦☆\n得快点确认下新的情报呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7609c1ad837d1ec4040176444068671ddd325eb7ba17afdd245ee58a1ba7567d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:002ddacab55ab74797404063",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～有新的礼物送到了呢～\n会不会是粉丝送的呢？去看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c4574986f7c3ebd323b74498af07b5c1c63617d553e1f6acb7e46f552e14179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7347ca6e455870eaed0b6195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了哦☆\n不管是做马娘偶像还是做训练员，\n最重要的都是踏踏实实地努力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ffea029ba3bb5ad5a363f67e4183b54e7a20f6b181f7f4460f9af311cfb1abb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0923664a721bb35972f602ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动要开始了哦！\n也许正是马娘偶像的活跃之时了哦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b851dbaa9d5b5614704bb95304bfffbdbc32ccfd88749d2c33c33022176ec6a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:007999a15d4129df535df61c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了！\n得让大家都来看看\n飞鹰子闪耀的笑容呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23dc892d93c16cb4b46137c528804a39dd225928e91fc48ae79cd8b105320736",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9b85aa88caeab7d91c5f3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，输了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d7a2f7ae19446f566a96aa13606308632fa1416ad2707fcda4c8c7cbb84d89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f523c3e28ba54f2123c8b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马娘名鉴，等级上升♪\n要好好确认一下哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37996abab5ca68a7357cf2821ab4036645adbf9fae7bdda09237eb3027e29269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1977ee2dc5d9bc7c38aabc71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的便服应该大多会配合\r\n这个发饰来设计穿搭～\r\n……因为这发饰对我来说很重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f59ed624ad641d7b1f15adbc60c4a4c7411b9e0d8d4ef0d6a0e3e2979f54d08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98facddb803176c11f2a9697",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子家经常要跟着父母调职\r\n搬来搬去！所以……对于各地的\r\n演唱会会场要怎么去，超有信心☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "906d31a50430334ca9be19f8471653c329daace7d8ebef1720d6a778e2c47e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:971a18a996d210ccaeaf7602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀告诉我的那间蛋糕店……\r\n真是好吃……呜……我得忍耐到\r\n下次演唱会结束才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff30b7862f903c1ac38ccc1441dcccf70d135e51060baf58a3e31d12232eca7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43619206c9d6ef36a845fb65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局了呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76461d847e1341400ff1dea9c749297812710b7c89947a31679b98438e758af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6815a85fd76e15cbfebef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的胜利呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd13b73db794043ac196f1b95e5d48b0e100731a9ae0217a58f8071ad4c1876",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a0f0b3739b07897b1d6cb02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，输了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d7a2f7ae19446f566a96aa13606308632fa1416ad2707fcda4c8c7cbb84d89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8241b2b0c85c20287d60e244",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局了呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76461d847e1341400ff1dea9c749297812710b7c89947a31679b98438e758af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f0ed6bebc897c365fbbc9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快看，新的最高分哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5d98b28a8da13cc73ef92a33d06d3b0699eebe42bb82c4c7a247a43dd31fc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:995de7990297d65983023c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "齐心协力，一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e3f38a6dfbbd03d87ecb68d692448fc7034f88217ac3fb7dcf2876ef3235d31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
